osu_std_renderer/curves/sliderpath.py contains a bit-exact port of
MIT-licensed geometry from ppy/osu-framework (PathApproximator.cs,
CircularArcProperties.cs) and ppy/osu (SliderPath.cs) — attribution in the
file header. osu_std_renderer/curves/legacy_random.py ports ppy/osu
LegacyRandom.cs (MIT). osu_std_renderer/ruleset/ruleset.py ports judgment
logic from ppy/osu (MIT): HitWindows.cs, OsuHitWindows.cs,
LegacyHitPolicy.cs, StartTimeOrderedHitPolicy.cs, DrawableHitCircle.cs,
DrawableSlider.cs, DrawableSliderBall.cs, SliderInputManager.cs,
SliderEventGenerator.cs, DrawableSpinner.cs — attribution in the module
docstring and per-function docstrings.

osu_std_renderer/render/hud.py ports the layout/behaviour/animation
semantics of MIT-licensed ppy/osu HUD components: ArgonScoreCounter.cs,
ArgonAccuracyCounter.cs, ArgonComboCounter.cs, ArgonCounterTextComponent.cs,
ArgonWedgePiece.cs, ArgonHealthDisplay.cs (+ ArgonHealthDisplayParts and
the osu-resources sh_ArgonBarPath*/sh_ArgonBarPathUtils shaders),
ArgonKeyCounter(Display).cs, ArgonSongProgress(Bar/Graph).cs,
SongProgressInfo.cs, RollingCounter.cs, ScoreCounter.cs,
PercentageCounter.cs, LegacyScoreCounter.cs, LegacyAccuracyCounter.cs,
LegacyDefaultComboCounter.cs, LegacyHealthDisplay.cs,
LegacyKeyCounter(Display).cs, LegacySongProgress.cs, LegacySpriteText.cs
— attribution in the module docstring. osu_std_renderer/ruleset/health.py
ports osu.Game/Rulesets/Scoring/DrainingHealthProcessor.cs and
osu.Game.Rulesets.Osu/Scoring/OsuHealthProcessor.cs (MIT, ppy/osu).

osu_std_renderer/render/lazer_results.py ports the layout/animation
semantics of the MIT-licensed ppy/osu ranking screen: ScorePanel.cs,
Expanded/ExpandedPanelMiddleContent.cs, Expanded/Accuracy/AccuracyCircle.cs,
Expanded/StarRatingDisplay.cs, Screens/Ranking/Statistics/
PerformanceBreakdown.cs, and osu.Game.Rulesets.Osu/Statistics/
{HitEventTimingDistribution,AccuracyHeatmap}.cs — attribution in the module
docstring. All default textures remain procedurally baked in-repo (no ppy
asset files).

BUNDLED FONT — osu_std_renderer/assets/fonts/Nunito[wght].ttf is the Nunito
variable font by Vernon Adams, Cyreal, Jacques Le Bailly and the Nunito
Project Authors, redistributed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
The full licence is bundled alongside it at osu_std_renderer/assets/fonts/
OFL.txt (redistribution requires the licence to travel with the font).
"Nunito" is a Reserved Font Name under the OFL. Nunito renders the skinless
"Argon league" text — the judgment popups (GREAT/OK/MEH/MISS), HUD labels,
hit-circle combo numbers and results-screen text — as a free, commercial-use
stand-in for lazer's non-commercial Torus; the custom-skin/legacy path keeps
DejaVu (a system font, not bundled). The procedural Argon 7-segment counter
digits are not a font.
